# Alien Symbiosis: the discard is owed on every cast from the graveyard (CR 118.8, 601.2f), so with an empty hand it is
# not offered there (CR 118.3: a cost can't be paid without the resources to pay it fully). Faithless Looting draws two
# Swamps and discards Alien Symbiosis and one Swamp; the other Swamp is played, leaving no card in hand. Mox Jet, Mox
# Pearl and the Swamp could pay {1}{B}, it is Bot1's main phase with the stack empty and Ornithopter is a creature to
# enchant, so only the discard keeps it from being cast.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Faithless Looting
Alien Symbiosis
Ornithopter
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Alien Symbiosis; Swamp)
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 0
! Bot1.Graveyard.Alien Symbiosis.Cast(Ornithopter)

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Faithless Looting; Swamp; Alien Symbiosis
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 0
